    {
      "parameters": {
        "promptType": "define",
        "text": "=You are an AI support classifier. Analyze this client message and output ONLY valid JSON without markdown wrapping:\n\nClient message: {{ $('Normalize Input').item.json.message }}\nProject: {{ $('Normalize Input').item.json.project_name }}\n\nTasks:\n1. Classify category into: [\"Technical Issue\", \"Integration/API\", \"Project Status\", \"Bug Report\", \"Feature Request\", \"Billing\", \"General Inquiry\"].\n2. Detect sentiment as: \"Frustrated\", \"Neutral\", or \"Positive\".\n3. Assign sentiment_score: 0 (most negative) to 100 (most positive).\n4. Assign priority: \"High\", \"Medium\", or \"Low\" (Mark \"High\" if production outage, critical bug, data loss, or intense frustration).\n\nRespond EXACTLY in this JSON format:\n{\n  \"category\": \"General Inquiry\",\n  \"sentiment\": \"Neutral\",\n  \"sentiment_score\": 50,\n  \"priority\": \"Low\",\n  \"reasoning\": \"Brief explanation\"\n}",
        "batching": {}
      },
      "type": "@n8n/n8n-nodes-langchain.chainLlm",
      "typeVersion": 1.9,
      "position": [
        -3952,
        1184
      ],
      "id": "cdc7cd7a-82b0-4541-9592-585828778ae8",
      "name": "AI Triage & Analysis"
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "options": {}
      },
      "type": "@n8n/n8n-nodes-langchain.lmChatGoogleGemini",
      "typeVersion": 1.1,
      "position": [
        -4080,
        1376
      ],
      "id": "002bce38-14d3-4b7b-9777-6ec36aaa8125",
      "name": "Google Gemini Chat Model",
      "credentials": {
        "googlePalmApi": {
          "id": "2iuYFOKF0RtEigVq",
          "name": "Google Gemini(PaLM) Api account"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "jsCode": "const raw = $input.item.json.text || $input.item.json.output || '';\nlet parsed;\ntry {\n  const jsonMatch = raw.match(/\\{[\\s\\S]*\\}/);\n  parsed = JSON.parse(jsonMatch ? jsonMatch[0] : raw);\n} catch (e) {\n  parsed = null;\n}\n\nconst ticket = $('Ticket Creation').item.json;\nconst normalized = $('Normalize Input').item.json;\n\nconst category = parsed?.category || 'General Inquiry';\nconst sentiment = parsed?.sentiment || 'Neutral';\nconst sentimentScore = Number.isFinite(Number(parsed?.sentiment_score)) ? Number(parsed.sentiment_score) : 50;\nlet priority = parsed?.priority || 'Low';\n\nconst msg = normalized.message.toLowerCase();\nconst urgentKeywords = ['production', 'down', 'urgent', 'asap', 'broken', 'critical', 'fatal', 'error 500'];\nif (urgentKeywords.some(k => msg.includes(k)) || sentimentScore < 30) {\n  priority = 'High';\n}\n\nreturn [{\n  json: {\n    id: ticket.id,\n    client_name: normalized.client_name,\n    client_email: normalized.client_email,\n    project_name: normalized.project_name,\n    message: normalized.message,\n    category: category,\n    sentiment: sentiment,\n    sentiment_score: sentimentScore,\n    priority: priority,\n    reasoning: parsed?.reasoning || 'Defaulted'\n  }\n}];"
      },
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.code",
      "typeVersion": 2,
      "position": [
        -3728,
        1184
      ],
      "id": "7ca760bf-ed58-4056-8edd-1051fe6e68a9",
